<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 12: </span>Impact of different retention thresholds on summary quality. Values are Median<sub id="A6.T12.5" class="ltx_sub"><span id="A6.T12.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Std</span></sub>. MESA scores are 1–5 Likert ratings,
ROUGE (R-1/R-2/R-L) and BERTScore (BS) are 0–100. <span id="A6.T12.6" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#D4F4E9;">Green</span> is best in category.</figcaption>
